<!-- Unknown / typo'd tag. Unknown tags fall through to the default blocks parser
     (parseOLX), so parsing SUCCEEDS with no ErrorNode in the tree. The failure
     surfaces only at RENDER time as render.tsx's "No component found"
     DisplayError — inline JSX, NOT an olxjson ErrorNode.

     NOTE: this means collectErrors (which scans the tree) does NOT see it.
     render-time validation / missing-component errors are a channel the in-tree
     query doesn't cover — see docs/error-handling-design.md. -->
<BadBloke/>
